{
  "an4.54:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.54 ",
  "an4.54:0.2": "6. Puññābhisandavagga ",
  "an4.54:0.3": "Dutiyasaṁvāsasutta ",
  "an4.54:1.1": "“Cattārome, bhikkhave, saṁvāsā. ",
  "an4.54:1.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.54:1.3": "Chavo chavāya saddhiṁ saṁvasati, ",
  "an4.54:1.4": "chavo deviyā saddhiṁ saṁvasati, ",
  "an4.54:1.5": "devo chavāya saddhiṁ saṁvasati, ",
  "an4.54:1.6": "devo deviyā saddhiṁ saṁvasati. ",
  "an4.54:2.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, chavo chavāya saddhiṁ saṁvasati. ",
  "an4.54:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, sāmiko hoti pāṇātipātī adinnādāyī kāmesumicchācārī musāvādī pisuṇavāco pharusavāco samphappalāpī abhijjhālu byāpannacitto micchādiṭṭhiko dussīlo pāpadhammo maccheramalapariyuṭṭhitena cetasā agāraṁ ajjhāvasati akkosakaparibhāsako samaṇabrāhmaṇānaṁ; ",
  "an4.54:2.3": "bhariyāpissa hoti pāṇātipātinī adinnādāyinī kāmesumicchācārinī musāvādinī pisuṇavācā pharusavācā samphappalāpinī abhijjhālunī byāpannacittā micchādiṭṭhikā dussīlā pāpadhammā maccheramalapariyuṭṭhitena cetasā agāraṁ ajjhāvasati akkosikaparibhāsikā samaṇabrāhmaṇānaṁ. ",
  "an4.54:2.4": "Evaṁ kho, bhikkhave, chavo chavāya saddhiṁ saṁvasati. ",
  "an4.54:3.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, chavo deviyā saddhiṁ saṁvasati? ",
  "an4.54:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, sāmiko hoti pāṇātipātī …pe… micchādiṭṭhiko dussīlo pāpadhammo maccheramalapariyuṭṭhitena cetasā agāra